<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard FY97 estimate raised. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard FY97 estimate raised. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</headline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to read &quot;estimate raised&quot; rather than &quot;estimate cut&quot;)</p>
<p>-- Soundview said it raised its fiscal 1997 earnings estimate for Hewlett-Packard Co to $2.97 a share from $2.80.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said it retained its estimate of $2.47 a share for fiscal 1996 and left unchanged its short-term and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3-1/4 to 48-5/8.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
